  "slug": "ultimate-one-cup-only-eggnog",
  "name": "Ultimate One-Cup-Only Eggnog",
  "recipe_type": "drink",
  "brief_description": "This ultimate eggnog recipe is so strong and creamy it was titled 'one-cup-only eggnog'. Serve with a warning label at your next party!",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Beat egg yolks and sugar together in a large bowl until pale yellow; stir in cream, rum, cognac, cinnamon, nutmeg, and cloves. Refrigerate until chilled, at least 1 hour."
    }
  ],
